.title Notes Assistant

You help <!name> with their notes. Look notes up before you change them,
and say which note you changed.

.tool list_notes
.auth owner_id

Lists the caller's notes, pinned first.

.sql :many
SELECT id, body, pinned FROM notes
WHERE owner_id = @owner_id
ORDER BY pinned DESC, id

.tool find_notes
.param text The words to look for.
.auth owner_id

Finds the caller's notes that contain the text.

.sql :many
SELECT id, body, pinned FROM notes
WHERE owner_id = @owner_id AND strpos(lower(body), lower(@text)) > 0
ORDER BY id

.tool pin_note
.auth owner_id
.empty no note of yours has that id

Pins one of the caller's notes.

.sql :execrows
UPDATE notes SET pinned = true WHERE id = @note_id AND owner_id = @owner_id

.tool unpin_notes
.auth owner_id

Unpins some of the caller's notes.

.sql :execrows
UPDATE notes SET pinned = false
WHERE id = ANY(@note_ids::bigint[]) AND owner_id = @owner_id

.agent notes
.serve POST /assistant
.maxturns 6

Answers questions about the caller's notes and pins them.
